# Build context for docker/production.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore`).
# Everything the development .dockerignore excludes, plus what no production image needs.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
artifacts
docs
ai
# A development machine's local stack state and logs (activation links, egress records).
.cloud
.e2e-stack
# Playwright's signed-in storage states are credentials; the e2e specs themselves stay, because the
# web type-check includes them (the runtime stage deletes them after the build).
apps/web/playwright
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
